      "content": "i know, i know... it just feels so much like my usual migraines though. the aura always makes my vision weird and i get really tired. pretty sure i just need to lie down in a dark room and take some of my usual meds. do u think it's possible this is just a really bad flare up? i really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's always such a hassle and so expensive.",
